WEBVTT

00:00:00.572 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.177 --> 00:00:04.270
Lots of staff, and everyone hears the news a little differently?

00:00:04.619 --> 00:00:08.350
VaraaAi's Team hub is a shared workspace for your whole team:

00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:12.110
chat, notices, and training, all in one place.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.809
Tap Team hub.

00:00:14.158 --> 00:00:17.969
The overview shows how many members your team has, and the three main parts:

00:00:18.079 --> 00:00:20.609
Team chat, Notices, and Training.

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:25.105
In Team chat, the Whole salon group already includes every member.

00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:27.265
Type your message and tap send.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.585
You can send photos and videos too.

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:32.785
Tap New chat to message one staff member privately.

00:00:33.344 --> 00:00:35.845
Notices are for official news from the owner:

00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:38.485
rotas, house rules, events.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:43.605
Tap Write a notice, enter a title and your message, then choose the priority:

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:46.245
Normal, Important, or Urgent.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:50.012
You can Pin it to the top, and switch on Ask staff to confirm,

00:00:49.962 --> 00:00:51.445
so you see who has read it.

00:00:51.873 --> 00:00:53.365
Then tap Post notice.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:56.169
Training is your salon's own library.

00:00:56.204 --> 00:01:00.609
Tap Add a lesson, give it a title, choose a topic, write the steps,

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:02.169
or paste a YouTube link.

00:01:02.518 --> 00:01:05.552
Switch on Required if every staff member must complete it,

00:01:05.502 --> 00:01:06.889
and you can track who has.

00:01:07.158 --> 00:01:08.889
Then tap Save lesson.

00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:12.169
Your staff can open it and learn on their phone, any time.

00:01:12.414 --> 00:01:13.609
Now take the quiz below.
